<p>Hello,</p>

<p>
  Your <%= @invoice.amount.format(with_currency: true) %> invoice to <%= @event.name %> was rejected.
</p>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Position:</strong> <%= @position.title %></li>
  <li><strong>Description:</strong> <%= @invoice.name %></li>
  <li><strong>Period:</strong> <%= @invoice.period_label %></li>
  <% if @invoice.rejection_reason.present? %>
    <li><strong>Reason:</strong> <%= @invoice.rejection_reason %></li>
  <% end %>
</ul>

<p>
  If you have questions, reply to this email. You can submit a corrected invoice from <%= link_to "your HCB pay page", my_pay_url %>.
</p>

<p>
  Sincerely,
  <br><br>
  The HCB Team
</p>
